# The large CVOL csvs are CME licensed data and re-fetchable from QuikStrike,
# so they stay out of git. data/raw/ and data/cot.csv are tracked instead:
# raw/ is irreplaceable (rateprobability exposes only 5 dates, so a missed day
# is a permanent gap) and cot.csv is public CFTC data.
data/*
!data/raw/
!data/cot.csv
market_data.csv

# Raw chat transcript - contains session cookies and a real qsid
first-history.md

# Superseded local copy of rates.py
rates1.py

# Saved page dumps used to inspect control ids
cme.html

# run_daily.py output
logs/

